{"id":8964334,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer/merge_requests/9414","number":9414,"state":"merged","title":"fix(fa): 修复TND格式下空kv batch散布中间导致精度问题","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/9414","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/9414/issues","body":"## 描述\n\nTND格式下空kv batch(S_q>0但S_kv=0)散布在batch中间时，FlashAttentionScore算子精度失败：153 batch中75个空kv batch，6个非空batch的max_abs_err高达4.7，错误集中在query序列末尾。\n\n### 根因\n\n空kv batch的s1块被计入totalSize参与多核分配，但kernel遇到s2LoopLimit=-1(因S_kv=0)跳过内层s2循环，导致流水线4槽环形buffer(runInfo[taskId & 3])的生产/消费时序错位：\n- s2LoopLimit=-1使内层循环不执行，taskId不步进\n- 后续非空batch的BMM1写入槽位与Vec1/Vec2消费槽位错位\n- Vec1消费BMM1结果时读到的是错误batch的数据，精度被破坏\n\n仅在空kv batch散布中间时出问题：尾部空batch的滞留结果不会被后续batch覆盖；散布中间时每个空batch后跟着非空batch，滞留结果被反复覆盖，放大误差。\n\n## 改动\n\n### tiling侧 — flash_attention_score_tiling_varlen.cpp (+15)\n\n- `SetMultiCoreParamsRegbase`：累加accumS1BlockNum时跳过actualSeqLenKvData[i]==0的batch，空kv batch的s1块不进totalSize，不参与多核任务分配\n- 新增全空保护：所有batch的KV均为0时totalSize==0，置coreNum=1避免totalSize/(coreNum*2)除零，其余多核参数置0，kernel空跑安全返回\n- `InitSparseValidArray`：同步跳过空kv batch，保证sparse valid数组与多核分配一致\n\n### kernel侧 — flash_attention_noquant_kernel_base.h (+26)\n\n- 新增私有方法`SkipEmptyKvBatches`，在`ComputeAxisIdx`的TND路径调用(初始查找+循环推进两处)\n- 用while循环跳过连续多个空kv batch的s1块计数(不累加s1OuterSizeAcc)，但保留偏移累积(s1SizeAcc/s2SizeAcc/b1SSOffset/b1SSOffsetAlign16)确保TND连续存储的数据定位正确\n- 空kv batch的query数据S1>0仍占TND连续存储位置，偏移累积断了会导致后续batch读错数据\n\n### kernel侧 — flash_attention_score_kernel_train.h (+14/-1)\n\n- `CalS1OuterSize`：主循环前的位置初始化器，同步跳过空kv batch的s1块计数，用continue逐个跳过(该函数是遍历所有batch的for循环，区别于ComputeAxisIdx的增量推进需while)\n- `b1SSOffsetAlign16`累加改为`if constexpr (hasDrop)`条件守卫，与ComputeAxisIdx中对齐(原先无条件累加，dropout未启用时该偏移无意义，属顺带的一致性修正)\n\n### 作用域\n\n仅影响arch35 TND训练路径，不影响arch22/infer/非TND/空tensor路径。tiling与kernel两层协同：tiling把空kv batch从多核任务池移除，kernel在轴索引计算时再次跳过，双重保险且数据偏移连续不断。\n\n## 关联的Issue\n#4041\n\n## 测试\n- 153 batch全量精度验证：修复前6个失败，修复后0个失败\n- 隔离测试：6个之前失败的batch全部通过\n- 回归测试：原有BNSD用例无回归\n\n## 类型标签\n- [x] \uD83D\uDC1B Bug 修复\n","assignees_number":27,"assignees":[{"id":"67316f3b33741160e675146e","login":"guijianwei","name":"guijianwei","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ae/bf/a7eb56f670f3a3d16d77b3266fbd1952b5cf6aaa23e71dde6976eeb6db8d8995.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/guijianwei","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822c87d24adff5452d7ba18","login":"Allan_Yu","name":"YuZhengzhong","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Allan_Yu","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68c115ac4dcd85262391d21a","login":"wenxin_fight","name":"wenxin_fight","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wenxin_fight","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822b81724adff5452d7afc2","login":"monologue815","name":"monologue815","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/monologue815","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68c2315759d71b2d89a80e41","login":"tang-hao-hw-gitcode","name":"tang-hao-hw-gitcode","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/tang-hao-hw-gitcode","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6877715d70f8532fca319fe9","login":"liudan12","name":"liudan12","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/liudan12","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822c79924adff5452d7b9b8","login":"yang-binrong","name":"yang-binrong","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/yang-binrong","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822c187053cff786c91063e","login":"xuanyuandy","name":"xuanyuandy","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/xuanyuandy","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"676e56c602d89015b9f1eb74","login":"hz36amy_00","name":"yf_zhou","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fc/fe/f7239cf91485e812c31979edd3584327eaab4edbd7f232c495d1e234e28e9df3.png?time=1757139706596","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/hz36amy_00","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68c130b72c2c2604ed91d3d4","login":"miaofangzheng","name":"miaofangzheng","html_url"